{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟開始向Windows 11 Beta頻道用户逐步推出新版Windows搜索體驗。用户可在任務欄搜索框輸入「開啓深色模式」「打開藍牙」「調暗屏幕」或「靜音」等指令，直接完成常用系統操作；搜索也能幫助將窗口並排排列，減少打開「設置」應用或跳轉其他頁面的步驟。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586216.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.067964+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:08:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"f2307d7fb87543a4d41f446e3df1a9d1791a91486ed20a727c42d69a965d667a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}